sn't fit the 9/30 digest, which describes it as freshly submitted with a different site. It may be a reused number or a digest error. Support's own record should settle it.\n\nI left out the following:\n- #4812 (EV charger bays, Mar 2025) is Vantorre Mobility.\n- #PD-4402 is Quillfeather.\n- Trailer 8836 in the Hartford room is a trailer number.\n- Several Moss digests mention Vantorre work with no ticket number: 2025-03-10, 2026-05-03 and 2026-08-03 (the Hartford Sev 1).\n\nThis comes only from those three sources. I haven't looked at the support system itself, so this may not be the full ticket history.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126","thread_ts":"1792159200.000125"}}
